	<string id="st_raid_gps_beacon">
		<text>GPS beacon</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_gps_beacon_descr">
		<text>A beacon for a stash. Put it into a stash on a raid level: the stash shows on the map of the shelter's laptop (the Raid app), with what is in it.\nIt runs for a week from the first stash, then goes flat and the mark is gone. A flat beacon is charged at a workbench with batteries.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_gps_beacon_dead">
		<text>GPS beacon (flat)</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_gps_beacon_dead_descr">
		<text>A flat GPS beacon. Charged at a workbench with batteries.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_busy">
		<text>In the raid: %s</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_news_title">
		<text>Raid</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_news_start">
		<text>%s went on a raid (%s).</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_news_died">
		<text>%s died on the raid (%s).</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_news_out">
		<text>%s came back from the raid (%s).</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_woke">
		<text>You wake up in the shelter. What was found on the raid is lost; %s things gone.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_too_late">
		<text>Too dangerous. Too much time has passed, the safest stretch is over</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_cooling_text">
		<text>"Guys, the Radar antennas have slowed down, the background has dropped! Whoever wanted to slip through to Limansk, move it before our brains boil again!"</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_cooling_sender_1">
		<text>Grey, master</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_cooling_sender_2">
		<text>Capercaillie, master</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_cooling_sender_3">
		<text>Merlin, master</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_cooling_sender_4">
		<text>Elk, master</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_window_soon">
		<text>The window closes soon. Time to go back.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_window_closed">
		<text>The window has closed. The Brain Scorcher is gaining power!</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_rescue_signal_scientists">
		<text>A faint distress signal. A group of scientists somewhere mid-town.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_rescue_signal_medic">
		<text>A signal from the Hospital's catacombs: an army assault group pinned down by the Monolith. Wounded, a medic with them.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_rescue_signal_frame">
		<text>Monolith talk. A commander with valuable cargo at the building site.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_rescue_joined_scientists">
		<text>The scientists follow you. Lead them to the exit.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_rescue_joined_medic">
		<text>The assault group follows you. Lead them to the way out.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_rescue_done_frame">
		<text>You have the incubator frame.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_rescue_no_further">
		<text>You can't go further with them. Lead them out first.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_rescue_lost">
		<text>The rescue failed.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_news_rescued_scientists">
