	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_news_lost_frame">
		<text>%s: the incubator frame was not taken (%s).</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_cooling_title">
		<text>Common net</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_rescue_signal_sect">
		<text>Intercept: a Monolith science group works in the Sarcophagus, with a commander and blueprints.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_rescue_done_sect">
		<text>You have the sect's blueprints.</text>
	</string>
