	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_sect_blueprints">
		<text>Sect blueprints</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_sect_blueprints_descr">
		<text>Compact capacitor schemes from the Monolith's science sector. The generator's artefact runs down slower with them.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_reinforce">
