	<string id="st_raid_doc_psi_screens">
		<text>Psi screen blueprints</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_doc_psi_screens_descr">
		<text>A folder from the Monolith's lab: psi radiation shielding schemes with notes in the margins. Scientists pay well for it.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_doc_gauss">
		<text>Gauss technology schemes</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_doc_gauss_descr">
		<text>Calculations of accelerators and capacitors for gauss weapons. Traders don't haggle over papers like these.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_doc_synthesis">
		<text>Synthesis protocols</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_doc_synthesis_descr">
		<text>A Monolith scientist's flash drive: protocols of experiments with artefacts. Encrypted, but valuable all the same.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_rescue_wounded_medic">
		<text>The assault group is wounded and can't walk. Talk to them: they need medicine.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_rescue_wave_medic">
		<text>The Monolith heard you! Hold the place with the group.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_rescue_arrived_medic">
		<text>The assault group is out: %d of %d.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_assault_need">
		<text>Two are badly hurt, the rest barely stand. We won't make it without medicine. We need: %s. Got it?</text>
	</string>
	<string id="raid_assault_medicine_0">
		<text>Hold on. What happened?</text>
	</string>
	<string id="raid_assault_medicine_2">
		<text>Here, take the medicine.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="raid_assault_medicine_3">
		<text>Not yet. I'll find it and come back.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="raid_assault_medicine_4">
		<text>Thanks, stalker. Quiet... Hear that? The Monolith is coming. We hold here; once they're beaten, we follow you.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="raid_assault_medicine_5">
		<text>Be quick. We won't last long here.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_assault_name_commander">
		<text>Captain Remezov</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_assault_name_mg">
		<text>Sergeant Boyko "Bumblebee"</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_raid_assault_name_soldier_1">
